# Root defaults for local development. Copy to `.env` and adjust if needed.
# Local development must never require a secret value (spec §7, §47).

# Where the website's Play button points.
VITE_GAME_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Development asset server (see tooling/scripts/asset-server.ts).
ASSET_PORT=9000

# Private asset store (ADR-0015). Assets whose redistribution rights are not
# settled live outside the repository; the asset server serves them under
# /store/ when this points at them. Leave it unset: a clean clone then loads the
# committed placeholders and says so on screen.
# WOV_ASSET_STORE=/srv/assets/store

# The one directory the API may import a scene bundle from (ADR-0033). The
# editor's *World -> Import scene bundle...* names a file relative to it, and
# nothing outside it can be read. Leave it unset and the action answers 501,
# which is the right answer for a service nobody configured for imports.
# WOV_IMPORT_DIR=/srv/scene-bundles
